  "translation": "Gomme ge malatsi a mokete wa go nwa a ile a dikologa, Ijobo o ile a romela gomme a ba kgethwa; gomme a hudugela mesong, a phahlamisa dibego tša go fišwa — palo ya tšona ka moka — ka gobane Ijobo o be a re: Mohlomong bana ba ka ba dire dibe, gomme ba boketše Elohim dipelong tša bona. Bjalo Ijobo o ile a dire malatsi ka moka.",
